X:1
T:Aalo Aamar Aalo Ogo
C:Rabindranath Tagore
S:notes: data/raw_data/midi/rs000111.mid (Geetabitan, arranged by Anjan Ganguly), violin track
S:lyrics: data/raw_data/text/lyrics/rs000111.txt (Geetabitan transliteration)
S:alignment: data/raw_data/swaralipi/rs000111.pdf (Geetabitan swaralipi)
N:Notes quantized to 16ths, pitch bends applied (scripts/midi_to_ktab.py read_tracks). Sa = C; Ma is shuddha (F) except two notes of F# in the sanchari as the MIDI plays them.
N:Form played by the MIDI: sthayi twice; antara; sthayi; sanchari twice (the swaralipi's { } repeat); abhog; sthayi to end.
N:Where the MIDI's notes differ slightly from the swaralipi (bar 125, "nijhar": G2 G F2 G for pa pama -pa) the MIDI is followed; syllables are placed where the swaralipi starts them.
N:v2: the same notes, lyrics and bars as v1.abc with note values halved (L:1/16, M:3/8, Q:1/4=100 is the speed of v1 at 200), so the tab plays at 100 bpm; one swaralipi matra = one eighth note here.
